extend default

block vars
  - const page_title = 'Search for Non-Conformance by Component Type or UUID';

block extrascripts
  block workscripts 
    script(src = '/pages/search_nonConformanceByComponentTypeOrUUID.js')

block content
  .container-fluid
    .vert-space-x2
      h2 Search for Non-Conformance by Component Type or UUID

    .vert-space-x1
      .panel.panel-default
      .foldable-heading.panel-heading.collapsed(data-toggle = 'collapse' data-target = '#descriptionBox')
        | Description: 
        i.chevron.fa.fa-fw 

      .collapse#descriptionBox
        p This page may be used to search for <b>non-conformance actions</b> under one of the following scenarios:
        ul
          li <b>either</b> all non-conformance actions performed on a specified <u>component type</u>
          li <b>or</b> all non-conformance actions performed on a <u>single component</u>, specified by its UUID

        p If searching by component type, the only required search parameter is the 'component type' - selectable from the dropdown menu.  The search may be optionally filtered by selecting a particular non-conformance disposition and/or status from their respective dropdown menus.

        p If searching by component UUID, the UUID input box uses auto-complete - users may begin manually entering a UUID, and up to 10 matching entries currently in the database will be displayed.  The auto-complete system is responsive - meaning that the list of displayed matches will be dynamically updated as more of the UUID is entered.
          br
          |  The component UUID may alternatively be provided in full by scanning a component's QR code.  This can be done by simply pressing the 'camera' icon to the right of the UUID input box, and directing your device's camera view to the QR code in question.

        p In either scenario, a summary of the found non-conformance actions will be displayed in the results panel below the input selections.

    .vert-space-x2 
      hr

      .row
        .col-md-4
          h4 Select Component Type

          .vert-space-x1
            p 
            | Select a component type below.<br>
            | <b>This is a <u>required</u> parameter.</b>

          .vert-space-x1 
            select.form-control#componentTypeSelection
              option(value = '')
              option(value = 'assembledApa') Assembled APA 
              option(value = 'groundingMeshPanel') Grounding Mesh Panel 

          .vert-space-x1
            input.form-control.spacer

          .vert-space-x1
            button.btn-primary.btn-lg#confirmButton_type Search by Component Type

        .col-md-4 
          h4 Filter by Disposition or Status

          .vert-space-x1 
            p 
            | These are both optional parameters.<br>
            | They only apply when searching by <b>component type</b>.

          .vert-space-x1 
            select.form-control#dispositionSelection
              option(value = 'any') (any)
              option(value = 'useAsIs') Use As Is (NC concession granted)
              option(value = 'repair') Repair (no modification to base design or functionality)
              option(value = 'rework') Rework (modification to base design but no impact to function)
              option(value = 'returnToSupplier') Return to Supplier 
              option(value = 'rejectRePurpose') Reject/Re-purpose
              option(value = 'scrap') Scrap 

          .vert-space-x1 
            select.form-control#statusSelection
              option(value = 'any') (any)
              option(value = 'open') Open 
              option(value = 'closed') Closed 

        .col-md-4
          h4 Search by Component UUID

          .vert-space-x1
            p 
            | Enter a component UUID below.<br>
            | Alternatively, take a picture of the component's QR code.

          .vert-space-x1 
            #componentUuidSelection

          .vert-space-x1
            button.btn-primary.btn-lg#confirmButton_uuid Search by Component UUID

      .vert-space-x2
        hr

      .vert-space-x1 
        h4 Search Results

        .vert-space-x1
          table#results1

    .vert-space-x2
